INE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 교원자격증(정교사2급) 원본 1부.<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 제출기한 : </span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">2010. 7. 16(금)까지<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3. 제출장소 : 각 전공 행정실<br><br></font>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 2.8pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;</font>\n</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 1.5pt\">2010.06.</span></font></p><font face=\"굴림\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 1.5pt\">금오공과대학교 교육대학원장</span></p>\n</font><p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</font><p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
